  moduleId: MC_001
  moduleTitle: Parkway Drive
  moduleText: 'Parkway Drive is a modern heavy metal band part of the metalcore scene
    orginary from Australia. Their heaviest album is Horizons, followed by Atlas.
    They include a lot of pyrotechnics and even string ensembles for a more dramatic
    effect. For the song Crushed, the singer is lifted on to a 10m platform while
    their drummer spins in a fire circle. Some of their members: Winston (Vocals),
    Jeff (Lead Guitar), Ben (Drums)'
  questions:
